WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 17=

02:07.440 --> 02:08.039
Your Highness.

02:08.880 --> 02:10.240
You only took half the antidote.

02:10.840 --> 02:12.720
Why don't I handle things today instead?

02:13.040 --> 02:14.360
The Chancellor won't suspect us.

02:15.480 --> 02:16.720
Yang Wanqing's the type

02:18.000 --> 02:19.640
who jumps at any chance to pounce

02:19.880 --> 02:21.000
if I slip up.

02:21.920 --> 02:23.120
If I send you alone,

02:23.360 --> 02:25.080
they will say
I didn't take it seriously.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.200
Still…

02:27.440 --> 02:28.080
Don't worry.

02:28.880 --> 02:30.200
I already have someone in mind.

02:30.920 --> 02:32.280
Someone who can get us out of here

02:32.640 --> 02:34.400
without raising
the Chancellor's suspicions.

02:38.120 --> 02:40.080
Mu Wuxia actually had
the nerve to snub me?

02:40.560 --> 02:41.160
Take this!

02:43.720 --> 02:45.040
You look terribly upset.

02:45.840 --> 02:47.160
Was it Prince Wuxia?

02:49.400 --> 02:50.000
No.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.120
Why would I be mad

02:51.200 --> 02:52.040
at him?

02:52.760 --> 02:54.800
But I just heard you say
he brushed you off.

02:55.520 --> 02:59.600
Don't tell me our sweet little Qingying

03:00.320 --> 03:01.760
has fallen for Prince Wuxia.

03:04.040 --> 03:04.720
You're too sharp.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.080
How do you know everything?

03:08.240 --> 03:08.840
Fine.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.360
Mu Wuxia turned me down.

03:10.880 --> 03:12.200
You're always glued to my brother.

03:12.520 --> 03:13.280
It's just annoying.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.400
Aren't you curious

03:15.520 --> 03:17.760
why your brother and I
are so deeply in love?

03:18.600 --> 03:19.640
I could teach you the way.

03:21.040 --> 03:21.840
He turned me down.

03:22.080 --> 03:23.200
Why would I like him at all?

03:23.600 --> 03:26.160
Prince Wuxia isn't
the only man out there.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.960
You might meet someone else
down the road.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.560
The skill could come in handy.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.480
I've been looking everywhere for you.

03:37.280 --> 03:37.920
What's going on?

03:39.240 --> 03:39.840
I…

03:40.800 --> 03:42.040
That's a secret between us girls.

03:42.120 --> 03:42.840
Not telling you.

03:43.720 --> 03:44.320
Let's go.

03:54.440 --> 03:55.040
Chancellor.

03:57.280 --> 03:57.880
Chancellor.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.240
Per your orders,

03:59.320 --> 04:00.680
we pulled our men back.

04:00.920 --> 04:02.360
We told Wang Xi to keep things normal

04:02.440 --> 04:03.480
at Prince Wuxia's residence.

04:03.560 --> 04:04.640
The assassins lost patience.

04:04.880 --> 04:06.120
They showed up outside his gate.

04:07.320 --> 04:07.920
Let's go.

04:08.720 --> 04:12.600
(Lip Rouge Shop)

04:16.480 --> 04:17.720
Will this really work?

04:19.279 --> 04:21.440
"A gentle lady makes a worthy match".

04:22.240 --> 04:23.560
Sometimes, we girls

04:23.640 --> 04:25.080
need a little extra help

04:25.480 --> 04:27.400
just to catch a man's eye.

04:36.440 --> 04:37.960
Who is that ghoul in the mirror?

04:44.280 --> 04:45.560
What's with that hideous makeup?

04:46.400 --> 04:48.080
Sorry, Qingying.

04:48.480 --> 04:50.560
I've never actually put on rouge
for anyone before.

04:50.880 --> 04:52.040
My bad.

04:54.400 --> 04:55.000
Here.

04:55.160 --> 04:55.760
Hurry, hurry!

04:56.520 --> 04:58.120
Could you fix it up for her?

04:58.480 --> 05:00.520
If I ruin your business,

05:00.720 --> 05:01.800
I'll never live it down.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.160
Of course.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.080
Don't worry, Miss.

05:05.560 --> 05:06.480
I'll fix you right up.

05:17.640 --> 05:20.040
(Imperial Library)

05:56.120 --> 05:59.640
(Wuliu Residence)

06:03.440 --> 06:05.360
A touch of our rouge,

06:05.920 --> 06:08.280
and any man will be mesmerized
by your beauty.

06:12.680 --> 06:13.280
Jiang Taohua!

06:13.640 --> 06:14.760
How do I look now?

06:19.160 --> 06:19.760
Jiang Taohua?

06:21.560 --> 06:23.680
She ditched me again!

06:32.600 --> 06:34.000
But she wasn't wrong…

06:35.160 --> 06:36.880
There are plenty of men in the world.

06:37.520 --> 06:38.920
I'll find someone even better.

06:40.320 --> 06:41.000
Go away!

06:41.400 --> 06:42.040
You reek of sweat.

06:42.120 --> 06:43.720
Handing out visiting cards like that?

06:43.800 --> 06:45.200
Don't come back, or I'll crush you!

06:48.440 --> 06:49.320
Tell your master this.

06:49.720 --> 06:51.240
The day I rise to fame,

06:51.560 --> 06:53.920
he'll regret how he treated me today.

06:54.800 --> 06:56.040
Keep dreaming, brat.

06:56.600 --> 06:57.240
Scram.

07:01.600 --> 07:02.280
Here, your book.

07:05.240 --> 07:06.040
And you are?

07:06.720 --> 07:08.600
Just someone who couldn't
stand by and watch.

07:08.680 --> 07:09.960
Is someone giving you a hard time?

07:10.040 --> 07:10.960
I'll handle it for you.

07:11.160 --> 07:11.800
Forget it.

07:12.200 --> 07:13.160
It's just a piece I wrote.

07:13.240 --> 07:14.560
It didn't catch that owner's eye.

07:14.880 --> 07:15.960
I'll try my luck elsewhere.

07:18.600 --> 07:20.240
Most people would keep it quiet

07:20.480 --> 07:21.200
if their articles

07:21.280 --> 07:22.280
got rejected.

07:22.680 --> 07:24.320
But look at you,
not a care in the world.

07:26.720 --> 07:27.920
My writing wasn't chosen,

07:28.280 --> 07:29.600
that doesn't mean I lack talent.

07:30.160 --> 07:31.640
It just means the person judging it

07:31.880 --> 07:33.320
had no eye for brilliance.

07:34.280 --> 07:36.560
It's easy to find gold,
but hard to find a kindred spirit.

07:36.960 --> 07:37.920
If no one truly gets me,

07:38.000 --> 07:38.720
I'll keep my work

07:39.000 --> 07:39.600
to myself.

07:48.880 --> 07:49.920
That temperament

07:50.000 --> 07:51.480
feels oddly similar to mine.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.680
Over eight feet tall,

07:56.360 --> 07:57.240
with a handsome face.

07:58.080 --> 07:59.400
Just a little on the skinny side.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.240
No matter. I can feed him well.

08:01.920 --> 08:03.480
There really are
so many better options.

08:03.560 --> 08:05.400
I just met one as soon
as I stepped outside.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.080
Hold up.

08:10.440 --> 08:11.400
What's your name?

08:12.160 --> 08:13.240
Li Jiaohan, at your service.

08:14.240 --> 08:14.840
Mr. Li.

08:15.280 --> 08:17.320
Fate must have brought us together
in the great city

08:17.680 --> 08:18.360
of Yujing.

08:19.280 --> 08:20.560
The weather's lovely today.

08:21.200 --> 08:23.320
What say you and I
take a stroll around Lake Tai?

08:27.240 --> 08:28.280
Fresh melons!

08:28.680 --> 08:29.600
Fresh melons!

08:30.920 --> 08:31.720
Sweet and juicy!

08:32.799 --> 08:33.480
Come have a look!

08:33.919 --> 08:34.520
Fresh melons!

08:45.200 --> 08:46.200
Where have you been?

08:46.640 --> 08:47.960
Did you finish the master's task?

09:13.880 --> 09:14.960
Tough one, isn't he?

09:15.440 --> 09:16.040
Chancellor.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.000
We got the poison pouch.

09:22.120 --> 09:23.200
Anyone living in Yujing

09:23.720 --> 09:25.440
must have heard about me.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.440
Tell me what you know.

09:27.800 --> 09:28.920
I'll make it quick for you.

09:29.920 --> 09:30.520
Otherwise…

09:31.600 --> 09:32.760
You're sharp, Chancellor Shen.

09:33.160 --> 09:33.880
But guess what?

09:34.200 --> 09:34.960
One set on dying

09:35.240 --> 09:36.160
can always find a way.

09:36.720 --> 09:37.640
He's biting his tongue!

09:40.840 --> 09:41.600
Take him away.

09:42.200 --> 09:43.520
Get something out of him.

09:43.680 --> 09:44.280
Yes, sir.

09:49.480 --> 09:50.160
(Strange…)

09:50.840 --> 09:52.680
(Assassins always prioritize the target)

09:53.120 --> 09:54.160
(and kill with one strike.)

09:55.360 --> 09:56.520
(But why are these assassins)

09:57.440 --> 09:58.760
(hiding in the marketplace?)

09:59.960 --> 10:00.720
(Are they decoy?)

10:01.960 --> 10:03.120
Zhan Lu, where's Prince Wuxia?

10:03.440 --> 10:04.080
Wuliu Residence.

10:05.720 --> 10:06.920
Let's go to Wuliu Residence.

10:07.040 --> 10:10.040
(Wuliu Residence)

10:33.120 --> 10:34.120
To borrow a book,

10:34.240 --> 10:35.160
please register here.

10:42.480 --> 10:45.200
(Mu Wuxia, Wuliu Residence)

10:45.400 --> 10:47.440
(So, Wuliu Residence is
Prince Wuxia's study.)

10:48.120 --> 10:48.720
(Oh no!)

10:50.800 --> 10:51.400
Wait!

11:04.080 --> 11:04.720
Out of the way!

11:05.400 --> 11:06.080
Move aside!

11:06.480 --> 11:07.120
Clear the way!

11:07.560 --> 11:08.160
Make way!

11:20.880 --> 11:21.480
Mu Wuxia.

11:21.760 --> 11:22.680
Heading to the Library?

11:23.040 --> 11:23.640
Yes.

11:23.920 --> 11:24.560
You just came out?

11:24.640 --> 11:25.240
Indeed.

11:34.960 --> 11:35.760
Whose book is this?

11:38.200 --> 11:39.920
What are you reading? Is it any good?

11:40.160 --> 11:41.400
"Chronicle of Unusual Spirits."

11:41.760 --> 11:42.600
Give it a try.

11:45.240 --> 11:45.840
Alright.

11:47.800 --> 11:49.640
(A scholar is with Miss Qingying…)

11:50.280 --> 11:51.120
(Who is he?)

11:53.840 --> 11:54.520
Miss Qingying!

11:58.800 --> 11:59.400
Hyah!

12:01.640 --> 12:02.240
Hyah!

12:03.640 --> 12:04.240
Whoa…

12:10.280 --> 12:12.440
(Imperial Library)

12:34.160 --> 12:36.920
(Wuliu Residence)

12:42.240 --> 12:42.840
Why are you

12:43.600 --> 12:44.360
here?

12:46.480 --> 12:47.360
I thought

12:47.760 --> 12:50.240
I'd surprise Qingying and Prince Wuxia.

12:50.920 --> 12:52.640
I didn't expect you to catch me first.

12:53.120 --> 12:54.440
Please don't tell anyone, alright?

12:55.640 --> 12:56.240
What surprise?

12:57.680 --> 12:59.760
Qingying has feelings for Prince Wuxia.

13:00.640 --> 13:02.840
He clearly feels the same way about her.

13:03.640 --> 13:05.000
I knew he'd come here today,

13:05.480 --> 13:06.440
so I thought I'd hide

13:07.200 --> 13:08.440
this red string ahead of time.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.680
I'd tell him Qingying

13:10.760 --> 13:11.920
made it specially for him.

13:12.160 --> 13:12.880
Give them a nudge.

13:21.240 --> 13:23.280
So, did you actually see Prince Wuxia?

13:26.400 --> 13:27.000
No.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.080
Oh right.

13:29.280 --> 13:30.800
What brings you here?

13:33.360 --> 13:35.800
Zhan Lu and I were tracking
a spy we've been investigating.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.040
The trail led us here.

13:40.760 --> 13:43.040
I've been here for a while,

13:43.640 --> 13:45.240
I haven't seen any spies around.

13:47.560 --> 13:48.600
Maybe they slipped away.

13:51.120 --> 13:51.840
Where is Qingying?

13:53.040 --> 13:54.240
She should be nearby.

13:54.680 --> 13:55.280
I'll find her.

13:58.640 --> 13:59.720
The city hasn't been safe.

14:01.000 --> 14:01.760
Be careful.

14:06.200 --> 14:07.400
You take care too, Chancellor.

14:28.400 --> 14:29.000
Chancellor.

14:30.200 --> 14:30.880
Did you find him?

14:31.120 --> 14:31.720
Yes.

14:31.840 --> 14:33.760
Prince Wuxia and Miss Qingying
are out together.

14:35.240 --> 14:35.840
What about her?

14:36.240 --> 14:36.840
Who?

14:40.520 --> 14:41.440
The Princess just left.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.440
She was heading toward the street.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.520
Do you think…

14:49.280 --> 14:50.440
Search the Library thoroughly.

14:50.720 --> 14:51.560
See if anything's off.

14:51.640 --> 14:52.240
Yes, sir.

15:11.760 --> 15:13.120
What is the gentleman's name?

15:13.240 --> 15:13.960
His surname's Zhu.

15:14.960 --> 15:16.440
A pig at the gate, and a mutt's friends.

15:16.520 --> 15:17.320
Shameless and petty.

15:17.600 --> 15:18.200
Basically

15:18.280 --> 15:19.840
a clueless, insufferable oaf.

15:21.560 --> 15:22.320
That's not true.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.280
Are you saying you understand women?

15:24.680 --> 15:25.360
No, I mean…

15:25.960 --> 15:27.760
I meant those insults you said

15:28.040 --> 15:29.600
are not the same as the surname Zhu.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.280
My surname is Mu.

15:36.480 --> 15:37.400
I'm Li Jiaohan.

15:38.680 --> 15:40.320
Mr. Mu, we've never met.

15:40.400 --> 15:41.640
Yet, you insisted on joining us.

15:42.360 --> 15:44.280
Are you perhaps acquainted
with Miss Qingying?

15:52.760 --> 15:53.360
I…

15:54.600 --> 15:56.880
I was just mesmerized

15:57.640 --> 15:58.840
by the wonderful scenery.

15:59.160 --> 16:00.760
I simply wanted to enjoy the view.

16:01.680 --> 16:03.440
You insisted on sitting with us.

16:04.120 --> 16:05.120
Now, you killed the mood.

16:10.600 --> 16:11.760
Why are you glaring at Mr. Li?

16:12.120 --> 16:13.200
No one asked you to come.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.280
- I didn't…
- Don't deny it.

16:16.040 --> 16:16.960
I saw everything.

16:17.520 --> 16:18.680
You've been glaring at him.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.440
If you hate to be here,

16:20.800 --> 16:21.480
just leave.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.040
- I'm not leaving.
- Watch out.

16:23.120 --> 16:23.720
I'm not leaving.

16:23.800 --> 16:24.480
If I go, we all go.

16:24.560 --> 16:25.280
Just go!

16:49.600 --> 16:51.680
A watcher becomes part of the play.

16:52.200 --> 16:55.040
Who'd have thought
he'd fall into the trap himself?

16:56.120 --> 16:57.040
What nonsense is that?

16:57.280 --> 16:58.120
Don't be ridiculous.

17:00.960 --> 17:02.840
(Chronicle of Unusual Spirits)

17:02.920 --> 17:03.560
Mr. Li,

17:04.640 --> 17:07.079
have you been reading
Chronicle of Unusual Spirits lately?

17:10.720 --> 17:11.400
A brilliant book.

17:11.760 --> 17:12.359
A masterpiece.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.680
Have you read it, Mr. Mu?

17:14.000 --> 17:15.400
You absolutely must give it a try.

17:17.079 --> 17:22.040
(Chronicle of Unusual Spirits)

17:23.800 --> 17:25.760
You really think it's a masterpiece?

17:29.480 --> 17:31.840
But the comment board at the Library

17:32.240 --> 17:33.840
is filled with harsh criticism.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.480
Most people don't think much of it.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.000
They all say

17:39.080 --> 17:40.880
the book is just
Mr. Nobody escaping reality.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.400
It's a naïve, idealistic work.

17:43.040 --> 17:43.960
But I think

17:44.160 --> 17:45.760
what they said is total crap.

17:46.840 --> 17:47.880
If policy is sound,

17:48.200 --> 17:49.600
then the Peach Blossom Spring

17:49.840 --> 17:51.080
that Jiang Kun longs for,

17:51.160 --> 17:53.520
where people are safe and live
as equals, will become true.

17:53.920 --> 17:55.520
Short-sighted people

17:55.760 --> 17:57.480
will never understand
Mr. Nobody's message.

17:58.280 --> 18:00.960
He was giving us hope.

18:03.120 --> 18:03.920
You really believe

18:04.680 --> 18:06.000
this book gives you hope?

18:06.280 --> 18:06.880
Of course.

18:07.720 --> 18:09.040
If you don't carry hope,

18:09.160 --> 18:10.640
what's the point of life?

18:15.720 --> 18:16.320
Right.

18:16.920 --> 18:17.960
I feel the same way.

18:19.400 --> 18:21.200
Sure, Jiang Kun's paradise

18:21.440 --> 18:22.320
may seem out of reach,

18:23.240 --> 18:24.280
but if even writers

18:24.360 --> 18:25.600
start censoring themselves,

18:26.280 --> 18:28.360
how's that any different
from the real world?

18:29.240 --> 18:30.640
Great minds think alike.

18:30.800 --> 18:31.760
We should drink to that.

18:32.160 --> 18:33.120
Finding a kindred spirit

18:33.520 --> 18:34.800
is worth celebrating with drinks!

18:35.040 --> 18:35.640
Yes!

18:36.160 --> 18:36.760
Come on.

18:38.040 --> 18:38.640
Mr. Mu.

18:38.720 --> 18:39.320
Mr. Li.

18:44.840 --> 18:45.680
Li Jiaohan!

18:46.040 --> 18:47.600
I asked you out first!

18:47.840 --> 18:49.080
Why are you all happy with him?

18:49.400 --> 18:51.480
A romance is pleasant,
but a kindred spirit is rarer.

18:51.640 --> 18:53.160
Mr. Mu and I hit it off at first sight.

18:53.240 --> 18:54.080
Of course I'm happy.

18:57.240 --> 18:58.680
How joyful to wander the gardens,

18:58.880 --> 19:00.160
endless wonders all around.

19:00.480 --> 19:01.800
A hundred flowers in bloom,

19:02.160 --> 19:04.200
terraces rise lofty and grand.

19:04.920 --> 19:06.160
Woods interlace in wild harmony,

19:06.480 --> 19:07.880
carps frolic in deep pools.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.960
Pellets strike birds mid-flight,

19:10.280 --> 19:11.960
lines cast to catch great fish.

19:14.880 --> 19:15.800
I don't know this part.

19:17.000 --> 19:18.320
Praises resound among the guests,

19:18.400 --> 19:19.800
in harmony despite different voices.

19:22.840 --> 19:23.480
Linchuan…

19:25.600 --> 19:26.640
Linchuan offers fine wine,

19:26.960 --> 19:28.240
songs rise with gleaming smiles.

19:28.440 --> 19:29.160
Yes! Yes!

19:29.640 --> 19:31.200
Elegant hands sweep across silk strings,

19:31.360 --> 19:32.720
melodies drifting with the breeze.

19:33.080 --> 19:34.520
Such a meeting is an utter delight.

19:34.640 --> 19:36.400
If only Master Dongye
were here to see it!

19:39.840 --> 19:41.560
Drinking in memory of the quiet soul,

19:41.920 --> 19:44.200
who kept his heart steady to the end.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.720
Enough poems!
Your pal fell into the lake!

19:50.520 --> 19:51.160
Mr. Li!

19:52.880 --> 19:54.120
I'm fine! I'm alright, Mr. Mu!

19:54.200 --> 19:54.800
Mr. Li!

19:56.040 --> 19:57.280
Let the seven strings speak,

19:57.760 --> 19:59.480
and carry my thoughts to a kindred soul.

20:28.640 --> 20:30.400
Why are you here?

20:32.120 --> 20:32.960
I thought

20:33.240 --> 20:36.040
I'd surprise Qingying and Prince Wuxia.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.440
I didn't expect you to catch me first.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.000
Please don't tell anyone.

20:46.080 --> 20:47.280
(I hope it's a coincidence.)

20:47.720 --> 20:48.800
(Maybe I'm overthinking it.)

20:49.840 --> 20:50.440
Chancellor.

20:50.800 --> 20:52.040
No trouble in the Library.

20:53.000 --> 20:53.960
But earlier this evening,

20:54.040 --> 20:56.000
at Wuliu Residence,
where Prince Wuxia frequents,

20:56.160 --> 20:57.280
we found a dead rat.

20:59.520 --> 21:00.640
There were no visible wounds.

21:00.920 --> 21:02.320
It looked more like poisoning.

21:03.440 --> 21:04.360
But what's odd is that

21:04.760 --> 21:06.840
the Library hasn't used
any rat poison recently.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.480
When you entered Wuliu Residence,

21:09.800 --> 21:11.760
did you notice a faint,
strange fragrance?

21:12.080 --> 21:12.680
Yes.

21:12.760 --> 21:14.800
There was a trace
of powdery perfume in the air,

21:15.120 --> 21:16.440
mixed with something else…

21:17.120 --> 21:18.120
The scent of soap pods.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.000
Very distinct.

21:19.360 --> 21:20.520
I've never smelled it before.

21:21.400 --> 21:22.360
Follow that lead.

21:23.360 --> 21:23.960
Understood.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.160
By the way, Chancellor.

21:25.920 --> 21:26.800
The assassin talked.

21:27.120 --> 21:28.160
He was acting under orders

21:29.000 --> 21:30.120
from Lan Boutique.

21:32.680 --> 21:33.440
Lan Boutique…

21:34.960 --> 21:35.560
Yes.

21:38.200 --> 21:39.240
If I remember correctly,

21:40.080 --> 21:42.160
all of the Princess's clothes
are custom-made there.

21:43.720 --> 21:44.840
That shopkeeper said

21:45.160 --> 21:46.200
the outfit Taohua wore

21:46.440 --> 21:47.720
was the most popular style

21:48.160 --> 21:50.280
among noble ladies in Yujing right now.

21:56.720 --> 21:58.760
(There was a trace
of powdery perfume in the air,)

21:59.080 --> 22:01.720
(mixed with the scent of soap pods.)

22:05.480 --> 22:06.240
I want a full list

22:07.200 --> 22:09.040
of all coming
in and out of Lan Boutique.

22:09.840 --> 22:11.880
Find out whether Jiang Taohua
has any ties to them.

22:12.560 --> 22:14.440
I want every detail
of their past interactions.

22:14.920 --> 22:15.520
Understood.

22:30.240 --> 22:34.040
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

22:37.160 --> 22:37.760
Your Highness?

22:42.560 --> 22:43.320
Your Highness…

22:51.160 --> 22:51.800
Your Highness?

22:51.880 --> 22:54.040
Should I go fetch a physician?

22:54.800 --> 22:55.480
It's no use.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.440
This poison

22:58.640 --> 23:01.920
can only be mitigated
with Yang Wanqing's antidote.

23:04.680 --> 23:05.400
She only gave me

23:06.200 --> 23:07.560
half a dose.

23:09.240 --> 23:11.200
She did it to make me suffer.

23:12.080 --> 23:13.280
To punish me.

23:14.600 --> 23:16.080
I have to go back to Lan Boutique.

23:19.960 --> 23:20.560
But,

23:20.960 --> 23:21.880
we failed her last order

23:21.960 --> 23:23.280
about lighting the incense.

23:23.760 --> 23:25.240
Would she give us the antidote again?

23:25.520 --> 23:27.600
As long as they still
need me as their pawn,

23:28.640 --> 23:29.760
they won't let me die.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.440
If I die…

23:34.320 --> 23:35.720
Who would do their dirty work?

23:38.000 --> 23:38.720
At worst,

23:39.840 --> 23:41.120
they'll humiliate me more

23:41.680 --> 23:42.840
and make fun of me.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.760
It's nothing I can't endure.

23:50.800 --> 23:52.680
Fetch a clean change of clothes for me.

23:53.520 --> 23:54.120
Yes.

24:01.080 --> 24:01.680
Qingtai.

24:05.520 --> 24:06.120
What is this?

24:08.040 --> 24:09.400
Her Highness wants to change.

24:09.720 --> 24:11.680
I'm bringing her some fresh clothes.

24:12.000 --> 24:13.760
Perfect timing.
I was just going to see her.

24:14.200 --> 24:15.160
I'll take it.

24:40.760 --> 24:41.920
Bring the clothes over.

24:55.320 --> 24:56.200
Thank you, Chancellor.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.200
Change your clothes this time?

25:00.920 --> 25:01.760
Are you going out?

25:02.160 --> 25:02.760
Yes.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.280
I want some fresh air

25:04.800 --> 25:06.840
and to see if there are
any new styles in fashion.

25:07.400 --> 25:10.280
Didn't you just add
a whole new wardrobe?

25:13.720 --> 25:15.080
But Chancellor,

25:15.640 --> 25:16.880
a girl can never

25:17.320 --> 25:18.640
have enough clothes.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.120
We'll always miss

25:20.640 --> 25:22.080
a shade of rouge.

25:22.920 --> 25:23.800
Now that you say it,

25:24.720 --> 25:26.200
I suppose I was being inconsiderate.

25:27.200 --> 25:27.800
My bad.

26:11.080 --> 26:11.720
What is this?

26:14.920 --> 26:17.520
It's the newest trend in Yujing.
It's called Peach Blossom makeup.

26:19.080 --> 26:20.280
Peach Blossom makeup?

26:22.040 --> 26:23.560
You women are a real mystery.

26:24.400 --> 26:25.640
You'd paint a lovely design

26:26.320 --> 26:27.520
on your arm instead.

26:28.120 --> 26:30.520
Best if you stop trying to guess
how women think, Chancellor.

26:43.680 --> 26:44.280
Fair enough.

26:45.480 --> 26:47.360
I really don't know much
about women's makeup.

26:48.240 --> 26:48.960
At first glance,

26:49.960 --> 26:52.240
I thought it was a tattoo of a spy.

26:55.040 --> 26:56.240
You jest, Chancellor.

26:59.560 --> 27:00.440
Why would there

27:01.120 --> 27:02.400
be spies?

27:05.680 --> 27:06.400
Why not?

27:09.200 --> 27:10.400
Just the other day,

27:11.320 --> 27:12.520
Zhan Lu caught a few spies

27:12.800 --> 27:14.600
from enemy states stirring up trouble.

27:18.560 --> 27:19.480
Your Highness,

27:20.080 --> 27:21.400
it's best not to leave the manor.

27:22.080 --> 27:22.760
There are things

27:23.600 --> 27:25.120
that can wait a little while longer.

27:25.760 --> 27:26.360
Right?

27:30.080 --> 27:31.360
I'm your wife.

27:32.320 --> 27:33.600
Who would dare

27:34.400 --> 27:37.120
lay a hand on me in broad daylight?

27:37.800 --> 27:39.760
"A wise one avoids danger."

27:40.800 --> 27:43.720
Or does Your Highness
have plans today that require you

27:44.360 --> 27:45.200
to go out?

27:53.520 --> 27:54.760
Your Highness

27:55.200 --> 27:56.520
should stay home for now.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.200
Once things settle down,

27:58.880 --> 27:59.920
I'll take you

28:00.680 --> 28:01.840
wherever you want to go.

28:02.440 --> 28:03.240
We can browse around

28:04.120 --> 28:05.520
for things you like.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.120
And if I say

28:10.280 --> 28:11.520
I must go out regardless?

28:12.320 --> 28:13.000
What, then?

28:25.560 --> 28:27.440
If Your Highness insists
on going out today…

28:28.560 --> 28:30.840
I'm afraid those clueless men
under Zhan Lu's command

28:31.840 --> 28:34.120
might mistake you for an enemy
and hurt you by accident.

28:35.400 --> 28:36.280
That'd be regretful.

28:38.160 --> 28:38.840
Your Highness.

28:39.520 --> 28:40.160
Don't you agree?

28:44.720 --> 28:45.920
I'll do as you say, Chancellor.

28:47.120 --> 28:48.720
I'll go out another day.

29:24.320 --> 29:24.960
Your Highness…

29:29.080 --> 29:29.960
That was a warning.

29:31.840 --> 29:33.280
What happened at the Library that day

29:35.160 --> 29:36.400
must have compromised me.

29:37.120 --> 29:37.720
Then…

29:38.040 --> 29:39.640
Are we still leaving today?

29:44.600 --> 29:45.240
Yes.

29:53.840 --> 29:54.760
You are right.

29:54.880 --> 29:55.960
She left Zhengchun Boudoir

29:56.040 --> 29:57.080
and went to the back gate.

30:13.920 --> 30:17.120
(Lan Boutique)

30:21.640 --> 30:26.800
(Lan Boutique)

30:31.600 --> 30:32.800
It's all Jiang Taohua's fault.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.480
She always ruins the plan.

30:35.160 --> 30:35.920
She's never completed

30:36.000 --> 30:37.320
a task Her Highness assigned.

30:38.600 --> 30:40.160
This attempt failed again. I'm afraid

30:41.080 --> 30:42.720
it's alerted Shen Zaiye.

30:44.480 --> 30:46.120
It will be harder to act from now on.

30:50.920 --> 30:51.520
Who's there?

30:57.280 --> 30:57.880
It's me.

31:01.320 --> 31:02.120
(Someone is inside.)

31:03.800 --> 31:04.840
(Could it be Prince Wuyin?)

31:05.680 --> 31:07.640
Does Your Highness
not know that the Chancellor

31:08.120 --> 31:10.040
is scouring the city
for suspicious persons?

31:10.920 --> 31:11.880
Showing up unannounced

31:12.400 --> 31:13.360
could bring us trouble

31:13.440 --> 31:14.760
and compromise my hideout.

31:14.880 --> 31:15.720
Don't be upset, Qing.

31:16.360 --> 31:17.640
I had no choice but to come.

31:19.240 --> 31:20.320
If I'm not mistaken,

31:21.360 --> 31:22.680
Her Highness's target

31:23.520 --> 31:24.360
is Prince Wuxia,

31:24.480 --> 31:26.280
who studies in the Imperial Library.

31:28.680 --> 31:29.280
So?

31:29.920 --> 31:31.360
Don't tell me you've gone soft

31:31.880 --> 31:33.400
and want to plead for Mu Wuxia?

31:33.840 --> 31:34.840
Qing, you misunderstood.

31:35.440 --> 31:36.520
I came here today

31:36.800 --> 31:38.960
to ask you for
the other half of the antidote.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.800
You haven't achieved a thing.

31:41.640 --> 31:43.560
What makes you think you deserve it?

31:44.640 --> 31:45.800
If you all had trusted me,

31:46.520 --> 31:47.120
instead of

31:47.360 --> 31:48.760
those clumsy assassins,

31:49.240 --> 31:50.640
I wouldn't have been dragged down.

31:50.960 --> 31:52.640
Mu Wuxia is as good as dead now.

31:54.480 --> 31:56.480
It's just that our first attempt failed,

31:56.880 --> 31:58.360
and even if there is a second chance,

31:58.720 --> 31:59.920
my body won't hold out.

32:00.680 --> 32:01.960
I have a foolproof plan.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.440
If all goes well,

32:03.960 --> 32:05.000
he will die in one strike.

32:06.040 --> 32:07.560
But only if Qing gives me the antidote.

32:08.800 --> 32:09.400
Otherwise,

32:10.080 --> 32:11.040
I'm afraid my body

32:11.400 --> 32:12.680
will ruin Her Highness's plans.

32:37.920 --> 32:39.360
I've agreed to give you the antidote.

32:40.440 --> 32:42.440
But if anything goes wrong again,

32:43.240 --> 32:44.120
you'll answer for it.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.040
Understood.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.920
Why did you agree to her terms?

32:55.440 --> 32:57.080
Jiang Taohua is not
to be underestimated.

32:58.800 --> 33:00.480
If she came all this way
to ask in person,

33:01.680 --> 33:03.000
what harm is there in saying yes?

33:04.080 --> 33:04.680
It's not like

33:04.760 --> 33:05.840
I actually believe her.

33:07.440 --> 33:08.800
If we want this mission to succeed,

33:09.360 --> 33:11.040
we'll need to give her a push.

33:15.600 --> 33:16.200
By the way…

33:18.040 --> 33:19.040
Any word

33:21.640 --> 33:22.360
from Beiyuan?

33:23.880 --> 33:25.040
After the last mission failed,

33:25.120 --> 33:26.280
we sent a letter.

33:27.360 --> 33:29.240
Her Highness hasn't
given any new orders since.

33:30.160 --> 33:30.840
I was wondering

33:31.760 --> 33:34.280
if she is angry that we botched the job?

33:47.920 --> 33:48.840
Then, we wait.

33:51.800 --> 33:53.560
She might just be held up

33:55.040 --> 33:55.840
with something else.

34:04.480 --> 34:08.040
(Shen Residence)

34:23.360 --> 34:24.040
You may go.

34:24.639 --> 34:25.239
Yes.

34:42.760 --> 34:43.400
Where were you?

34:45.040 --> 34:45.760
Lan Boutique.

34:47.120 --> 34:47.760
Why?

34:49.480 --> 34:51.040
Haven't you already figured it out?

34:51.920 --> 34:52.960
Why bother asking?

34:57.320 --> 34:58.120
Jiang Taohua…

35:00.040 --> 35:01.320
I gave you a chance.

35:02.760 --> 35:04.040
But you cast it away.

35:07.080 --> 35:08.600
I suppose I should thank you.

35:10.320 --> 35:12.200
You gave me the chance
to confess the truth.

35:18.200 --> 35:18.880
You once told me

35:18.960 --> 35:20.560
Prince Wuxia was like a brother to you.

35:21.960 --> 35:22.760
Is everyone expendable

35:22.840 --> 35:24.360
as long as you stand

35:24.520 --> 35:25.600
to gain the most?

35:26.520 --> 35:28.080
I already promised you

35:29.120 --> 35:30.720
I would never do anything to harm Qi.

35:31.400 --> 35:32.160
That promise

35:33.040 --> 35:34.600
includes Prince Wuxia of Qi.

35:35.640 --> 35:37.360
(I will never do anything to harm you)

35:37.680 --> 35:39.080
(or the State of Qi.)

35:40.840 --> 35:41.840
If I break that oath,

35:42.840 --> 35:44.920
may I never see my family again.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.160
If I break that oath,

35:49.120 --> 35:50.680
may I never see my family again.

35:51.000 --> 35:52.720
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

35:52.840 --> 35:56.040
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

35:56.760 --> 35:58.080
♪The flower fell♪

35:58.800 --> 35:59.600
It seems

36:01.080 --> 36:02.640
I've lost your trust.

36:04.000 --> 36:07.080
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

36:07.160 --> 36:10.480
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

36:10.960 --> 36:12.320
♪The flower weeps♪

36:12.400 --> 36:13.000
I trust you.

36:14.560 --> 36:20.320
♪With no one it can be brought♪

36:25.320 --> 36:32.280
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

36:32.640 --> 36:39.480
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

36:39.880 --> 36:46.880
♪Still I hope she'll pick
the flower kissed by dew♪

36:47.200 --> 36:54.200
♪Even if it means this flower
will be hers to give to someone new♪

37:09.880 --> 37:10.480
Your Highness.

37:12.640 --> 37:14.600
What did that treacherous Chancellor
say to you?

37:15.800 --> 37:16.720
He said he trusts me.

37:17.560 --> 37:19.040
And Your Highness told him everything?

37:19.680 --> 37:21.040
Can he really be trusted?

37:21.640 --> 37:23.920
If I didn't tell him,
he'd still find out sooner or later.

37:25.120 --> 37:26.680
Since that day at the Imperial Library,

37:27.720 --> 37:28.560
Zhengchun Boudoir

37:29.160 --> 37:30.600
has probably been under surveillance.

37:31.720 --> 37:33.120
And about Yang Wanqing?

37:33.480 --> 37:34.840
Has Your Highness made a decision?

37:36.040 --> 37:37.680
I had to talk circles around her today

37:38.000 --> 37:39.360
just to get half an antidote pill.

37:41.680 --> 37:43.360
If we don't act this time,

37:45.360 --> 37:46.600
we might never get another one.

37:46.760 --> 37:49.280
Are we really going to
lay a hand on Prince Wuxia?

37:50.280 --> 37:50.880
Never.

37:52.280 --> 37:54.160
We know how the Chancellor and Qingying,

37:54.280 --> 37:55.400
treat Prince Wuxia.

37:56.840 --> 37:57.560
Besides,

37:58.400 --> 37:59.840
when the Chancellor came after me,

38:00.720 --> 38:01.680
he still chose to protect

38:01.760 --> 38:03.480
a diplomatic princess
no one cared about.

38:03.760 --> 38:05.640
He was even willing
to turn on powerful ministers

38:05.720 --> 38:06.400
to save me.

38:07.480 --> 38:08.360
How could I

38:09.240 --> 38:10.480
betray such a kind soul?

38:11.480 --> 38:12.720
So, what's the plan now?

38:14.440 --> 38:16.400
Yang Wanqing is keeping
a close eye on me.

38:18.240 --> 38:18.880
Here's the plan.

38:19.720 --> 38:20.560
Leave the residence.

38:21.320 --> 38:23.520
Pretend to be looking
into Prince Wuxia's whereabouts.

38:24.480 --> 38:25.920
Draw Yang Wanqing's attention away.

38:27.040 --> 38:27.960
Make her think

38:28.520 --> 38:30.000
we are going after Prince Wuxia.

38:30.680 --> 38:31.840
That will buy us some time

38:32.360 --> 38:34.240
so I can figure out a foolproof plan.

38:34.640 --> 38:35.240
Got it.

38:51.760 --> 38:52.360
Your Highness.

38:52.640 --> 38:54.680
Princess Chengping invited you
to go out for a walk.

38:55.040 --> 38:56.680
Your carriage is waiting outside.

38:58.560 --> 38:59.600
Right now?

38:59.840 --> 39:00.440
Yes.

39:17.040 --> 39:17.720
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

39:17.800 --> 39:18.760
Your Highness, bad news!

39:19.080 --> 39:21.200
Yang Wanqing invited Prince Wuxia out
using your name!

39:21.560 --> 39:22.560
I knew something was off,

39:22.760 --> 39:23.920
so I rushed back to report it.

39:25.040 --> 39:25.640
Oh no.

39:26.640 --> 39:27.840
They didn't trust me,

39:28.080 --> 39:28.760
and made a move.

39:29.200 --> 39:30.360
Where is Prince Wuxia now?

39:30.960 --> 39:31.680
I saw him.

39:32.080 --> 39:33.760
He was headed toward Qinfang Teahouse.

39:34.360 --> 39:35.280
Inform the Chancellor!

39:36.040 --> 39:38.120
(Qinfang Teahouse)

39:48.920 --> 39:50.040
Your Highness, forgive me.

39:50.440 --> 39:52.240
His Majesty just summoned
the Chancellor.

40:17.480 --> 40:20.680
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

40:20.760 --> 40:23.800
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

40:24.720 --> 40:27.840
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

40:27.960 --> 40:31.720
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

40:32.000 --> 40:35.080
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

40:35.200 --> 40:38.520
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

40:38.920 --> 40:42.480
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

40:42.560 --> 40:48.280
♪With no one it can be brought♪

40:53.240 --> 41:00.160
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

41:00.600 --> 41:07.440
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

41:07.920 --> 41:14.920
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

41:15.240 --> 41:19.280
♪Even if it means this flower♪

41:19.400 --> 41:26.360
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

41:37.480 --> 41:40.600
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

41:40.680 --> 41:43.920
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

41:44.280 --> 41:47.960
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

41:48.080 --> 41:54.640
♪No longer needing to say♪

41:58.720 --> 42:05.640
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

42:06.040 --> 42:13.000
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

42:13.360 --> 42:20.360
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

42:20.720 --> 42:22.400
♪And finding♪

42:22.480 --> 42:29.480
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
